      "url": "https://www.pointloma.edu/offices/institutional-research",
      "summary": "The Institutional Research page at Point Loma Nazarene University provides access to DataPoint publications and the Common Data Set from recent years. Key metrics include enrollment, admissions, graduation and retention rates, and California License Examination Passage Rates. The DataPoints are available for various years up to 2025, and Common Data Set information is provided for the same period.",
