    {
      "doc_type": "glossary",
      "title": "Institutional Research",
      "url": "https://www.pointloma.edu/offices/institutional-research",
      "summary": "This section of Point Loma Nazarene University's website provides details about the Institutional Research office, including a list of publications like the PLNU DataPoint and Common Data Set. It offers links to view data sets and reports across several years (from 2013 to 2025) in various formats, such as Word, PDF, and Excel, focusing on metrics like enrollment, admissions, and graduation rates.",
